# Path to your Chrome or Chromium executable.
# Resumint will auto-detect common system locations, but set this if detection fails
# or if you want to pin a specific browser.
#
# Linux examples:
#   PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH=/usr/bin/chromium-browser
#   PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH=/usr/bin/google-chrome-stable
#
# macOS examples:
#   PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH=/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome
#   PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH=/Applications/Chromium.app/Contents/MacOS/Chromium
#
# Windows examples:
#   PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH=C:\Program Files\Google\Chrome\Application\chrome.exe
PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH=
